lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Howard County, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years since 1951, the same count as September to October and November to December. In 2025, August to September on the middle ran just 37% of normal. So far in 2026, March to April on the middle came in at 169% of normal. Grid 23249 had its driest year in 1956 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
